# Agent context budget

Open the workspace that matches the task tag — every workspace is multi-root and injects each loaded repo's `AGENTS.md` on every turn; all three also carry the sibling `docs` site repo as a peer root.

| Workspace | Use for |
|-----------|---------|
| [Monolith-Backend.code-workspace](../../Monolith-Backend.code-workspace) | API, migrations, seeders, PHP tests — `[backend]` |
| sibling `Monolith-SPA.code-workspace` | Vue screens, SPA i18n, Worker shell — `[frontend]` |
| [Monolith-Fullstack.code-workspace](../../Monolith-Fullstack.code-workspace) | Only when the contract moves: endpoints, Resource shapes, cookies/CSRF, headers, route names |

Per task open: the file under edit + its nearest test, and the **one** owning brief or rule. Never `@folder`, `@AGENTS.md`, or `@src/i18n/locales` in a prompt. Never `Read` a whole locale JSON — Grep the key, patch all locales.

Targets: `[backend]` / `[frontend]` median well under 70k tokens; fullstack contract under 120k.
